slider38:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 6 Clap Tune (st)
slider39:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 7 Perc Tune (st)
slider40:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 8 Rim Tune (st)
slider41:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 9 Ride Tune (st)
slider42:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 10 Crash Tune (st)
slider43:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 11 HH Closed Tune (st)
slider44:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 12 HH Open Tune (st)
