slider46:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 14 Misc 14 Tune (st)
slider47:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 15 Misc 15 Tune (st)
slider48:0<-12,12,0.1>-Pad 16 Misc 16 Tune (st)
slider49:100<0,100,0.1>-Pad 1 Kick Decay (%)
slider50:100<0,100,0.1>-Pad 2 Snare Decay (%)
